  "Apply a wavelet based denoiser. It transforms each frame from the video input into the wavelet domain, using Cohen-Daubechies-Feauveau 9/7. Then it applies some filtering to the obtained coefficients. It does an inverse wavelet transform after. Due to wavelet properties, it should give a nice smoothed result, and reduced noise, without blurring picture features.": "应用基于小波的降噪器。它使用 Cohen-Daubechies-Feauveau 9/7 将视频输入中的每一帧变换到小波域中。然后它对获得的系数应用一些过滤。之后它进行逆小波变换。由於小波特性，它應該提供良好的平滑結果，並減少噪聲，而不會模糊圖片特徵。",
