  "Number of audio channels. Converting to fewer channels mixes them down; ffmpeg is told to avoid clipping while doing so.": "音訊通道的數量。轉換為較少的頻道會使它們混合在一起； ffmpeg 被告知這樣做時要避免剪輯。",
