  "Percent of the source level.": "來源等級的百分比。",
  "Pixel format": "像素格式",
  "Placebo": "安慰劑",
  "Plays the video faster or slower by rescaling its timestamps. Only the video changes speed, so the audio will drift out of sync; consider removing the audio.": "透過重新縮放影片的時間戳來更快或更慢地播放影片。只有視訊會改變速度，因此音訊會漂移不同步；考慮刪除音訊。",
