  "Presets": "預設",
  "Presets imported": "導入預設",
  "Profile": "簡介",
  "Quality": "質量",
  "Quality level for constant-quality encoding. Lower is better quality and a bigger file. For x264, 23 is the default and about 18 looks visually lossless; x265 defaults to 28. Each step of about 6 roughly halves or doubles the file size.": "恆定品質編碼的品質水準。越低品質越好，文件也越大。對於x264，23是預設值，大約18看起來視覺上無損； x265 預設為 28。大約 6 的每一步大約會使檔案大小減半或加倍。",
  "Queue": "佇列",
  "Quiet": "安靜",
  "RTMP": "RTMP",
  "Rate control": "速率控制",
  "Raw encoder settings passed straight to x264 or x265 as key=value pairs separated by colons, e.g. keyint=72:scenecut=0. Only used with those two codecs.": "原始編碼器設定作為用冒號分隔的鍵=值對直接傳遞到x264或x265，例如keyint=72:場景剪輯=0。僅與這兩個編解碼器一起使用。",
  "Ready when you are": "準備好了",
  "Ready-to-use settings. Adjust after applying.": "即用型設定。塗抹後調整。",
  "Reduces noise and grain. Stronger settings remove more noise but also soften fine detail.": "減少噪音和顆粒。更強的設定可以消除更多雜訊，但也會柔化精細細節。",
  "Reduces small camera shake from hand-held shots or a bumped tripod. The edges uncovered as the frame shifts are filled in from the picture.": "減少手持拍攝或碰撞三腳架造成的輕微相機震動。幀移動時未覆蓋的邊緣將從圖片中填充。",
  "Remove banding artifacts from input video. It works by replacing banded pixels with average value of referenced pixels.": "從輸入影片中移除條帶偽影。它的工作原理是用參考像素的平均值替換帶狀像素。",
  "Remove file": "刪除文件",
  "Remove judder produced by partially interlaced telecined content.": "消除由部分隔行電視電影內容所產生的抖動。",
  "Remove subtitle": "刪除字幕",
  "Remove temporal frame luminance variations.": "去除時間幀亮度變化。",
  "Remove version": "刪除版本",
  "Removes the comb-like lines of interlaced video from old TV, DVDs or 1080i cameras. Leave it off for normal progressive video.": "移除舊電視、DVD或1080i相機中隔行掃描影片的梳狀線條。對於普通的漸進式視頻，請將其關閉。",
  "Removes the uneven motion left in partially telecined footage, where film was converted to TV frame rates.": "移除部分電視電影鏡頭中留下的不均勻運動，其中電影被轉換為電視幀速率。",
  "Remux to MP4 (no re-encode)": "Remux 到 MP4 (無需重新編碼)",
  "Reset": "重置",
  "Resizes the video. The presets set one side and keep the source aspect ratio for the other; Custom lets you enter both.": "調整影片的大小。預設設定一側並保持另一側的來源寬高比；自訂可讓您輸入兩者。",
  "Resolution": "分辨率",
  "Restore & Cleanup": "恢復與清理",
  "Restricts the encoder to a feature set so older or limited devices can play the file. Leave it on None unless a device or service asks for one.": "將編碼器限制為特徵集，以便舊的或有限的裝置可以播放檔案。除非設備或服務需要，否則請將其保留為“無”。",
  "Retry": "重試",
  "Rext": "雷克特",
  "Run command": "運行指令",
  "SRT": "SRT",
  "Sample rate": "取樣率",
  "Samples per second. 48k is standard for video and 44.1k for music. Raising it above the source adds size but no quality.": "每秒樣本數。 48k 是視訊標準，44.1k 是音樂標準。將其提高到來源之上會增加尺寸，但不會增加品質。",
  "Saturation": "飽和度",
  "Save": "保存",
  "Save preset": "儲存預設",
  "Save the current settings without source or destination paths.": "儲存目前設置，不包含來源路徑或目標路徑。",
  "Saved (Local Storage)": "已儲存（本機儲存）",
  "Scale (resize) the input video, using the libswscale library.": "使用libswscale庫縮放(調整大小)輸入影片。",
  "Scales the loudness: 100 leaves it unchanged, 50 halves it, 200 doubles it. Large increases can clip. Needs an audio codec other than Copy.": "縮放響度：100 使其保持不變，50 將其減半，200 將其加倍。大幅增加可能會導致削波。需要 Copy 之外的音訊編解碼器。",
  "Scaling": "縮放比例",
  "Search pages or actions": "搜尋頁面或操作",
  "Search presets": "搜尋預設",
  "Select FFmpeg executable": "選擇FFmpeg執行檔",
  "Select the pass number (1 or 2). It is used to do two-pass video encoding.": "選擇頻道號碼（1 或 2）。它用於進行兩遍視訊編碼。",
  "Selects a video codec.": "選擇視訊編解碼器。",
  "Selects an audio codec.": "選擇音訊編解碼器。",
  "Send program-friendly progress information to stdout.": "將程式友善的進度資訊傳送到標準輸出。",
  "Send program-friendly progress information.": "發送程式友善的進度資訊。",
  "Set audio volume expression. <code>output_volume = volume * input_volume</code>": "設定音訊音量表達式。 <code>輸出體積 = 體積 * 輸入體積</code>",
  "Set frame rate (Hz value, fraction or abbreviation).": "設定幀速率(Hz值、分數或縮寫)。",
  "Set logging level and flags used by the library.": "設定庫使用的日誌記錄等級和標誌。",
  "Set maximum output value for rematrixing. This can be used to prevent clipping vs. preventing volume reduction. A value of 1.0 prevents clipping.": "設定重新矩陣的最大輸出值。這可用於防止削波與防止體積減少。值為 1.0 可防止削波。",
  "Set optional x264 parameters to the encoder.": "將可選的x264參數設定到編碼器。",
  "Set optional x265 parameters to the encoder.": "設定編碼器的可選 x265 參數。",
  "Set pixel format. Use -pix_fmts to show all the supported pixel formats.": "設定像素格式。使用 -pix_fmts 顯示所有支援的像素格式。",
  "Set the -profile:v level for h.264.": "設定h.264的-profile:v等級。",
  "Set the audio sampling frequency. For output streams it is set by default to the frequency of the corresponding input stream. For input streams this option only makes sense for audio grabbing devices and raw demuxers and is mapped to the corresponding demuxer options.": "設定音頻取樣頻率。對於輸出流，它預設為對應輸入流的頻率。對於輸入流，此選項僅對音訊擷取裝置和原始解復用器有意義，並對應到對應的解復用器選項。",
  "Set the number of audio channels. For output streams it is set by default to the number of input audio channels. For input streams this option only makes sense for audio grabbing devices and raw demuxers and is mapped to the corresponding demuxer options.": "設定音訊通道數。對於輸出流，它預設為輸入音訊通道的數量。對於輸入流，此選項僅對音訊擷取裝置和原始解復用器有意義，並對應到對應的解復用器選項。",
  "Set the video display aspect ratio specified by aspect.": "設定由aspect指定的影片顯示寬高比。",
  "Sets the display aspect ratio stored in the file. It does not resize the pixels; players stretch the picture to this shape when showing it.": "設定儲存在檔案中的顯示縱橫比。它不會調整像素大小；玩家在展示圖片時將其拉伸成這個形狀。",
  "Shifts the audio later to fix sync.": "稍後移動音訊以修復同步。",
  "Show file": "顯示文件",
  "Simple audio dynamic range compression/expansion filter.": "簡單的音訊動態範圍壓縮/擴展濾波器。",
  "Sinc": "正弦",
  "Size": "尺寸",
  "Skip the decoding and encoding step for the specified stream, so it does only demuxing and muxing.": "跳過指定流的解碼和編碼步驟，因此它僅進行解復用和復用。",
  "Slow": "慢",
  "Slow Motion 50% (silent)": "慢動作 50% (靜音)",
  "Slower": "較慢",
  "Smooths out banding, the visible stripes in gradients such as skies. Useful on heavily compressed sources.": "平滑漸層中的條帶、可見條紋，例如天空。對於嚴重壓縮的來源很有用。",
  "Social & Mobile": "社交與移動",
  "Source": "來源",
  "Source & destination": "來源與目的地",
  "Source file": "原始檔",
  "Specifies a maximum tolerance. This is only used in conjuction with -bufsize.": "指定最大容差。它僅與 -bufsize 結合使用。",
  "Specifies a minimum tollerance to be used.": "指定要使用的最小容差。",
  "Specifies the GOP (Group of Pictures) size. This option is currently only supported by the x264 encoder.": "指定GOP(圖片組)大小。目前僅 x264 編碼器支援此選項。",
  "Specifies the decoder buffer size, which determines the variability of the output bitrate.": "指定解碼器緩衝器大小，其決定輸出位元率的可變性。",
  "Specifies the target (average) bit rate for the encoder to use.": "指定編碼器要使用的目標（平均）位元率。",
  "Specify a start timestamp.": "指定開始時間戳記。",
  "Specify a stop timestamp.": "指定停止時間戳記。",
  "Speed": "速度",
  "Spline": "樣條",
  "Square 1:1 1080x1080 (Feed)": "方 1:1 1080x1080（進給）",
  "Stabilize Action Cam 1080p": "穩定運動攝影機 1080p",
  "Start an encode from the workspace.": "從工作區開始編碼。",
  "Start time": "開始時間",
  "Stereo": "立體聲",
  "Still Image": "靜止影像",
  "Stop time": "停止時間",
  "Strip Audio (no re-encode)": "剝離音訊（不重新編碼）",
  "Subtitle": "副標題",
  "Super Fast": "超快",
  "Suppress printing banner.": "禁止列印橫幅。",
  "TCP": "TCP",
  "Target average bit rate. Add a unit: 3000k is 3 Mbit/s. A bare number means bits per second, so 2000 is only 2 kbit/s. Required for two-pass.": "目標平均位元率。增加一個單位：3000k 是 3 Mbit/s。裸數字表示每秒位數，因此 2000 僅相當於 2 kbit/s。需要兩次通過。",
  "The -profile:v option limits the output to a specific H.264 profile. Some devices (mostly very old or obsolete) only support the more limited Constrained Baseline or Main profiles. You can set these profiles with -profile:v baseline or -profile:v main.": "-profile:v選項將輸出限制為特定的H.264設定檔。某些設備（大多非常舊或過時）僅支援更有限的約束基線或主要配置檔案。您可以使用 -profile:v benchmark 或 -profile:v main 設定這些設定檔。",
  "The audio encoder. Pick one that the container supports and your players can decode.": "音訊編碼器。選擇容器支援並且您的玩家可以解碼的一種。",
  "The file format that holds the video and audio streams. It decides which codecs you can use and where the file will play.": "儲存視訊和音訊串流的檔案格式。它決定您可以使用哪些編解碼器以及檔案的播放位置。",
  "The file or stream to read. Use the protocol picker to fill in a URL template for FTP, HTTP, RTMP, SRT and so on.": "要讀取的檔案或流。使用協定選擇器填寫 FTP、HTTP、RTMP、SRT 等的 URL 範本。",
  "The file to write, always the last argument. Its extension follows the container chosen on the Format tab.": "要寫入的文件，總是最後一個參數。其副檔名遵循在「格式」標籤上選擇的容器。",
  "The removegrain filter is a spatial denoiser for progressive video. ": "去除顆粒濾波器是用於漸進視訊的空間降噪器。",
  "The resampling algorithm used when resizing. It only applies when a size is set.": "調整大小時所使用的重採樣演算法。它僅在設定尺寸時適用。",
  "The video encoder. It decides compatibility, file size for a given quality, and how long encoding takes.": "視訊編碼器。它決定相容性、給定品質的檔案大小以及編碼需要多長時間。",
  "Timelapse 5x (silent)": "遊戲中時光倒流 5x（靜音）",
  "Trace": "蹤跡",
  "Trades encoding speed for compression. Slower presets make a smaller file at the same quality; faster ones finish sooner with a bigger file. Pick the slowest you have patience for.": "以編碼速度換取壓縮。較慢的預設會在相同品質下產生較小的檔案；速度較快的檔案較大，完成得更快。選擇你有耐心的最慢的。",
