  "WebM": "WebM",
  "What to do when the custom size has a different shape from the source.": "當自訂尺寸具有與來源形狀不同的形狀時該怎麼辦。",
  "Where the clip begins, as HH:MM:SS (fractions like 00:01:30.5 work) or plain seconds. Placed after -i, so ffmpeg seeks accurately but reads from the start of the file to get there.": "剪輯開始的地方，如 HH:MM:SS（像 00:01:30.5 這樣的分數）或簡單的秒。放置在 -i 之後，因此 ffmpeg 可以準確地查找，但從文件的開頭讀取以到達那裡。",
  "Where the clip ends, measured from the start of the input, not the length of the clip. Same format as the start time.": "剪輯結束的位置是從輸入的開始處測量的，而不是剪輯的長度。與開始時間的格式相同。",
  "Where the ffmpegd daemon is listening. From an https page, a daemon on another machine must be served over https.": "ffmpegd守護程式正在監聽的地方。從 https 頁面，另一台電腦上的守護程式必須透過 https 提供服務。",
  "Which side the Size preset applies to. Widescreen sets the width; Full Screen sets the height. The other side follows the source aspect ratio.": "尺寸預設適用於哪一側。寬螢幕設定寬度；全螢幕設定高度。另一邊遵循源的縱橫比。",
